              "tweet_ids": [
                3,
                4,
                5,
                6
              ],
              "id": "2a.1"
            },
            {
              "text": "Evacuations began around 19:00 UTC on May 19 for residents in Estenwick and Dray Corners.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [
                13,
                17
              ],
              "id": "2a.2"
            },
            {
              "text": "Infrastructure damage and the destruction of Route 12 and a grain elevator in Dray Corners were reported between 19:16 and 19:47 UTC on May 19.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [
                21,
                29,
                30
              ],
              "id": "2a.3"
            },
            {
              "text": "Fatalities were confirmed in Millrow district and Estenwick Police deployed to the area after 21:51 UTC on May 19.",
